      "texto": "       MONITORING TRUSTEE IN CASE M.10699 – SalMar/NTS\n\n\n\nOn 3 November 2022 the Commission approved the appointment of:\n\n              Mazars LLP, represented by Justin Menezes, Partner\n\n                 Address: 30 Old Bailey, London, EC4M 7AU, United Kingdom\n\n                 justin.menezes@mazars.com\n\n               +32 (0)477 57 54 32\n\nas Monitoring Trustee in the above-mentioned case.\n\n\nThe role of the Monitoring Trustee is to monitor the compliance of SalMar with the\nCommitments attached to the Commission's Decision of 31.10.2022 and to report to the\nCommission thereon.\n\nThird parties who have queries in relation to the Commitments may contact the Trustee\nthrough the above contact details.\n\nThe foregoing  is without prejudice to the Commission's jurisdiction to oversee the\nimplementation of the Commitments attached to its Decision.",
